# regress/artifacts/pvrrenderexit/.gitignore -- written by the pvrrenderexit landing.  The BULK of this folder stays uncommitted
# (the coordinator's rule of 2026-11-05: blobs never leave history; adding a file later is cheap): the per-variant session
# transcripts, build and probe logs and the codex reasoning streams below, and the uncited one-off files present at the landing
# -- 49507 files, still on disk.  A file a committed record cites is re-included by a `!` line.  ANY OTHER FILE IS NOT IGNORED --
# an erratum or a new reading shows in `git status`: commit it.  Why each committed file is in: landing_20261105/ARTSET_pvr_why.txt;
# the rule: landing_20261105/ARTSET_RULE.md.

# per-variant session transcripts
**/sessions*/**
**/*_sessions*/**

# build logs (per variant, and each table's base/HEAD/restore builds)
**/build_*.log

# probe logs inside the table and measurement folders (per variant unless re-included below)
**/table*/probe*.out
**/table*/probe*.raw
**/meas*/probe*.out
**/meas*/probe*.raw

# codex reasoning streams
**/codex_*.err

